#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Compare two-qubit gate depth of unitary and dynamic circuits {#compare-two-"
"qubit-gate-depth-of-unitary-and-dynamic-circuits}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/dc-hex-"
"ising/extracted-outputs/36f1d72d-1.avif)\n"
